00:24:00.580 --> 00:24:04.880
ichido-kiri nara dekiru hazu da kara
I know I can do it, if only just once

00:24:06.380 --> 00:24:09.710
This story is fiction...

00:24:06.380 --> 00:24:09.710
but in 10 years, who knows?

00:24:13.680 --> 00:24:18.390
We watch as Kanuka
boards a jet, bound for home.

00:24:18.390 --> 00:24:22.350
But a strange criminal,
Nekowatari, hijacks the plane.

00:24:22.350 --> 00:24:24.190
What are his demands?

00:24:24.190 --> 00:24:27.570
And what does Kanuka's message
to Air Traffic Control mean?

00:24:27.570 --> 00:24:29.780
Kanuka, don't say goodbye.

00:24:29.780 --> 00:24:33.280
Hijacking at the
New Tokyo Airport.

00:24:33.280 --> 00:24:35.160
Coming next, "Farewell, Kanuka."

00:24:35.160 --> 00:24:36.820
Target: Locked on!

00:24:35.740 --> 00:24:40.750
Next episode

00:24:35.740 --> 00:24:40.750
Farewell, Kanuka
